1
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:09,100
"Sharehouse Part.1"
(Episode 1)

2
00:00:34,734 --> 00:00:35,702
Welcome~

3
00:00:35,702 --> 00:00:37,637
You're the new guy moving in right?

4
00:00:37,637 --> 00:00:38,872
Yeah that's me hi

5
00:00:38,872 --> 00:00:40,407
Here let me grab that

6
00:00:40,407 --> 00:00:42,075
Thanks

7
00:00:44,277 --> 00:00:46,079
Hi there

8
00:00:46,112 --> 00:00:47,113
Where'd you come from?

9
00:00:47,113 --> 00:00:48,248
Cheonan

10
00:00:48,248 --> 00:00:49,516
Lived there my whole life

11
00:00:49,516 --> 00:00:51,051
Must've been a long ride

12
00:00:51,051 --> 00:00:52,552
Did you take the subway here?

13
00:00:52,552 --> 00:00:54,888
Yeah kinda

14
00:00:54,888 --> 00:00:56,823
I grabbed a cab from the station

15
00:00:56,823 --> 00:00:58,124
So it was pretty quick

16
00:00:58,124 --> 00:01:01,294
These guys are the roommates you'll be living with

17
00:01:01,661 --> 00:01:03,630
Nice to meet you

18
00:01:03,630 --> 00:01:06,466
You know we've got a double room
and a triple room right?

19
00:01:06,466 --> 00:01:07,033
Yeah sure

20
00:01:07,033 --> 00:01:08,334
I signed up for the double room

21
00:01:08,334 --> 00:01:08,968
Got it

22
00:01:08,968 --> 00:01:10,370
That one's the double

23
00:01:10,370 --> 00:01:11,805
And that one's the triple

24
00:01:11,805 --> 00:01:13,907
And this is the kitchen

25
00:01:13,907 --> 00:01:16,409
We've got the basics like the rice cooker and all

26
00:01:16,409 --> 00:01:18,244
But you know guys living together

27
00:01:18,244 --> 00:01:19,379
We mostly order out

28
00:01:19,379 --> 00:01:22,482
We mostly just for instant rice

29
00:01:22,482 --> 00:01:23,883
Right…

30
00:01:23,883 --> 00:01:25,752
The rent's due every month

31
00:01:25,752 --> 00:01:28,054
Same day you moved in

32
00:01:28,054 --> 00:01:31,124
We collect utilities on the 10th each month

33
00:01:31,124 --> 00:01:32,592
Trash and recycling

34
00:01:32,592 --> 00:01:35,028
Over there if you take a look

35
00:01:42,802 --> 00:01:44,604
Why so late?

36
00:01:44,604 --> 00:01:46,506
We were introducing ourselves

37
00:01:46,506 --> 00:01:49,509
This is your roommate for the double room

38
00:01:50,143 --> 00:01:52,145
Hey

39
00:02:06,993 --> 00:02:08,495
Need a hand?

40
00:02:08,495 --> 00:02:09,696
It's okay

41
00:02:09,696 --> 00:02:11,631
I'm almost done

42
00:02:11,631 --> 00:02:13,032
How old are you?

43
00:02:13,032 --> 00:02:15,068
Twenty-six

44
00:02:15,668 --> 00:02:17,036
So you're older

45
00:02:17,036 --> 00:02:18,138
You can drop the formal stuff

46
00:02:18,138 --> 00:02:20,373
We're gonna be living together anyway

47
00:02:20,373 --> 00:02:21,975
Uh… sure

48
00:02:21,975 --> 00:02:23,343
You too

49
00:02:23,343 --> 00:02:24,277
Yeah

50
00:02:24,277 --> 00:02:25,612
What's your name?

51
00:02:25,612 --> 00:02:26,646
Nam Yoon Su

52
00:02:26,646 --> 00:02:27,580
You?

53
00:02:27,580 --> 00:02:28,882
Ha Jin

54
00:02:28,882 --> 00:02:31,518
Ha is my family name and Jin's my given name

55
00:02:32,719 --> 00:02:34,287
Pretty name

56
00:02:34,287 --> 00:02:35,922
Thanks

57
00:02:35,922 --> 00:02:37,390
(Dinner's ready!)

58
00:02:37,390 --> 00:02:38,525
Come on out

59
00:02:38,525 --> 00:02:40,193
Yeah coming

60
00:02:40,193 --> 00:02:41,561
You must be hungry right?

61
00:02:41,561 --> 00:02:42,762
Let's eat first

62
00:03:00,246 --> 00:03:02,682
What are you so focused on?

63
00:03:02,682 --> 00:03:03,449
Huh?

64
00:03:03,449 --> 00:03:05,852
Oh just a drama!

65
00:03:05,852 --> 00:03:06,386
Yeah?

66
00:03:06,386 --> 00:03:08,021
Which one?

67
00:03:08,621 --> 00:03:11,558
Uh… nothing special

68
00:03:11,558 --> 00:03:13,459
I think I'll crash first

69
00:03:13,459 --> 00:03:14,894
Already?

70
00:03:23,536 --> 00:03:25,471
I'm home~

71
00:03:29,375 --> 00:03:31,010
Everyone out?

72
00:05:04,170 --> 00:05:04,804
What're you looking at?

73
00:05:04,804 --> 00:05:05,972
Shit!

74
00:05:06,806 --> 00:05:08,074
That...

75
00:05:10,076 --> 00:05:11,944
Work stuff

76
00:05:11,944 --> 00:05:14,347
Just analyzing something

77
00:05:14,614 --> 00:05:15,948
Oh yeah?

78
00:05:15,948 --> 00:05:18,017
Actually

79
00:05:18,017 --> 00:05:20,019
I've got a meeting soon

80
00:05:39,172 --> 00:05:41,307
Ah fuck

81
00:05:41,541 --> 00:05:43,009
He definitely saw

82
00:05:43,576 --> 00:05:45,111
I'm so screwed

83
00:05:45,111 --> 00:05:47,680
How am I supposed to go back in there

84
00:05:50,016 --> 00:05:51,551
Wait no

85
00:05:51,784 --> 00:05:53,953
Maybe he didn't see it clearly

86
00:05:54,253 --> 00:05:56,255
He walked in...

87
00:05:56,255 --> 00:05:58,758
and I shut my laptop

88
00:06:00,993 --> 00:06:02,829
No he saw everything

89
00:06:02,829 --> 00:06:03,863
All of it

90
00:06:03,863 --> 00:06:05,098
I'm doomed

91
00:06:25,118 --> 00:06:26,552
He saw right?

92
00:06:27,019 --> 00:06:28,721
Of course he did

93
00:06:28,721 --> 00:06:30,656
He totally did

94
00:06:32,859 --> 00:06:40,600
(Hey Yoon Su where are you?)

95
00:06:56,315 --> 00:06:57,417
Shit!

96
00:06:57,417 --> 00:06:58,985
Yoon Su you're so late

97
00:06:58,985 --> 00:07:00,620
We've been waiting forever

98
00:07:01,687 --> 00:07:04,157
Sorry things piled up and I had to work late

99
00:07:06,325 --> 00:07:07,794
How was the meeting?

100
00:07:07,794 --> 00:07:09,095
Huh?

101
00:07:10,029 --> 00:07:11,664
Come in already the food's getting cold

102
00:07:11,664 --> 00:07:13,132
Hurry up hurry up

103
00:07:13,132 --> 00:07:15,001
You must be starving

104
00:07:16,602 --> 00:07:18,771
Cheers~

105
00:07:21,908 --> 00:07:23,976
Okay I'll go first

106
00:07:23,976 --> 00:07:25,511
In college fold

107
00:07:27,680 --> 00:07:30,283
I didn't wash my hair today fold

108
00:07:30,283 --> 00:07:31,117
Why're you staring at me?

109
00:07:31,117 --> 00:07:32,118
I washed mine today

110
00:07:32,118 --> 00:07:35,488
Please you overslept and skipped it again

111
00:07:35,488 --> 00:07:37,223
Fold fold fold

112
00:07:37,223 --> 00:07:38,691
Me right?

113
00:07:38,691 --> 00:07:40,593
Single life fold

114
00:07:41,427 --> 00:07:43,496
Oh we're playing like that huh

115
00:07:43,496 --> 00:07:44,330
My turn?

116
00:07:44,330 --> 00:07:46,632
If your MBTI starts with E fold

117
00:07:46,632 --> 00:07:48,801
Anyone who's watched porn in their room fold

118
00:07:50,503 --> 00:07:53,139
Come on every guy folds here right?

119
00:07:53,139 --> 00:07:54,740
Please stop

120
00:07:54,740 --> 00:07:56,075
Not me though

121
00:07:56,075 --> 00:07:57,176
Liar

122
00:07:57,176 --> 00:07:59,045
Never once in your room really?

123
00:07:59,045 --> 00:08:01,447
At least not in the shared room

124
00:08:01,447 --> 00:08:05,051
Wait do you seriously do that in here?

125
00:08:05,051 --> 00:08:05,785
No

126
00:08:05,785 --> 00:08:06,752
Hello?

127
00:08:06,752 --> 00:08:08,254
I've seen enough to know

128
00:08:08,254 --> 00:08:10,623
Why're you doing this to me?

129
00:08:16,162 --> 00:08:16,963
Okay whatever!

130
00:08:16,963 --> 00:08:18,664
Let's do the thing already

131
00:08:18,664 --> 00:08:19,999
That?

132
00:08:19,999 --> 00:08:22,235
Time flies huh?

133
00:08:22,235 --> 00:08:24,837
The… the thing?

134
00:08:25,171 --> 00:08:28,007
House rule exclusive to us

135
00:08:28,007 --> 00:08:29,342
We play a game every month

136
00:08:29,342 --> 00:08:30,877
The bottom two

137
00:08:30,877 --> 00:08:33,279
have to go on a date together on the weekend

138
00:08:33,279 --> 00:08:35,081
And come back with proof pics

139
00:08:35,081 --> 00:08:36,949
It's just to get closer

140
00:08:36,949 --> 00:08:38,251
No pressure okay?

141
00:08:38,251 --> 00:08:41,220
So the game is…

142
00:08:41,220 --> 00:08:44,223
Simple one this month rock paper scissors!

143
00:08:44,223 --> 00:08:46,359
Rock paper scissors!

144
00:08:46,359 --> 00:08:47,426
Rock paper scissors!

145
00:08:47,426 --> 00:08:48,628
Rock paper scissors!

146
00:08:48,628 --> 00:08:49,795
Rock paper scissors!

147
00:08:49,795 --> 00:08:51,364
Oh yes

148
00:08:51,364 --> 00:08:52,164
Yoonsu's last

149
00:08:52,164 --> 00:08:53,966
Congrats Yoon Su!

150
00:08:54,567 --> 00:08:56,502
One more loser to go

151
00:08:56,502 --> 00:08:59,572
Rock paper scissors or you lose!

152
00:09:00,172 --> 00:09:01,173
All right!!

153
00:09:01,173 --> 00:09:02,508
Oh come on

154
00:09:02,508 --> 00:09:04,043
- I already have a date!
- (As long as it's not Jinwoo!)

155
00:09:04,043 --> 00:09:05,044
(No way... Is this going to be picked?)

156
00:09:05,044 --> 00:09:08,147
Rock paper scissors or you lose!

157
00:09:08,614 --> 00:09:09,015
Yes

158
00:09:09,015 --> 00:09:10,783
Hajin's in!

159
00:09:10,783 --> 00:09:14,587
Well well look at the roommates pairing up

160
00:09:14,587 --> 00:09:17,623
Enjoy some cozy alone time this weekend

161
00:09:18,224 --> 00:09:20,426
Real cozy

162
00:09:21,394 --> 00:09:23,195
Didn't expect that

163
00:09:23,195 --> 00:09:25,531
Since it's happening anyway

164
00:09:25,531 --> 00:09:26,866
Let's have fun yeah?

165
00:09:26,866 --> 00:09:29,201
Yeah sure

166
00:09:30,036 --> 00:09:32,838
So… anything you wanna do?

167
00:09:32,838 --> 00:09:34,840
Somewhere you wanna go?

168
00:09:35,041 --> 00:09:37,343
Hmm not sure

169
00:09:37,710 --> 00:09:39,378
I'll have to think about it

170
00:09:39,378 --> 00:09:40,580
You?

171
00:09:40,580 --> 00:09:43,149
Plenty of things I wanna do with you

172
00:09:43,549 --> 00:09:44,884
Huh?

173
00:09:44,884 --> 00:09:47,687
(Is he... on purpose?)

174
00:09:50,800 --> 00:09:54,000
"Sharehouse Part.1"
